# Docker gate finding (Step 10, unnecessary-source-artifact check): the whole
# tree is developer-machine runtime data (logs, model artifacts, embeddings,
# CMS content) recreated by the app at first run — none of it belongs in the
# image. The prior partial list here still let ~400KB/90 files of local
# activity logs and metadata into the built image. Mirrors the same fix
# already applied to the repo's own .gitignore.
data_warehouse/
# C1.1 (P0 data hygiene): runtime never reads these; they must not reach the image.
# `dữ liệu/` once carried an unrelated employee export with personal data.
dữ liệu/
reports/
docs/
EduDSS_UI_Reference_Kit/
ui_reference/
*.docx
*.pptx
*.xlsx
deploy/
# Experimental Dockerfiles (not used by the release image).
docker/experimental/
